---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
import Cta from '../../components/Cta.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Factory-Direct Mass Transfer Equipment from China"
  description="Factory-direct supplier of tower packing and column internals: random and structured packing, mist eliminators, ceramic balls and adsorbents. ISO 9001-certified production."
  canonical="https://www.mass-transfer.com/about/"
  breadcrumb={[{ label: 'About' }]}
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="page-title">About Us</h1>
    <p class="page-sub">
      We supply mass transfer equipment factory-direct — one margin layer, not two.
    </p>

    <article class="prose">
      <h2>Who We Are</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE.legalName} is a factory-direct supply partner for random and structured packing, mist eliminators and tower internals. We are based in Pingxiang, Jiangxi — China's largest chemical packing and ceramic industrial base, where material supply, tooling and skilled labour are concentrated.
      </p>
      <p>
        Because we operate from within this industrial base, we can supply high-quality packing at factory-direct pricing, with fast engineering feedback on material selection, sizing and lead time.
      </p>

      <h2>Quality You Can Verify</h2>
      <p>
        Our production is <strong>ISO 9001-certified</strong>. Every batch can be accompanied by inspection and test reports covering dimensions, mechanical strength, material composition and (where relevant) chemical resistance. We do not ask you to trust a marketing claim — we show you the evidence.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Dimensional inspection against specification</li>
        <li>Mechanical strength and crush testing</li>
        <li>Material composition verification</li>
        <li>Packing, loading and shipment photo records</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We Work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Selection first</strong> — we help you choose the right packing and material for your medium and temperature before you buy.</li>
        <li><strong>Transparent lead times</strong> — delivery schedule confirmed in writing before you place an order.</li>
        <li><strong>Direct communication</strong> — you talk to an engineer and a sales manager, not a call centre.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>The Pingxiang Advantage</h2>
      <p>
        Pingxiang has manufactured chemical packing and ceramic tower internals for decades. That concentration of supply means competitive material cost, mature production techniques and reliable logistics — advantages we pass on as factory-direct supply.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-top:32px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);">
        Production partner background and export credentials:
        <a href="https://www.xinquan.net.cn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">xinquan.net.cn</a>
      </p>
    </article>

    <Cta heading="Talk to us about your next project" />
  </div>
</Layout>
